  "prefLabel": "Bfa 102.05 Board Structure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfa 102.05 Board Structure. The board shall, pursuant to RSA 162-A:4, consist of 14 directors. The directors shall be responsible for the operation of the authority. The governor and council appoint 9 directors. The speaker of the house of representatives appoints 2, nonvoting, directors. The president of the senate appoints 2, nonvoting, directors. The state treasurer is appointed as a nonvoting, ex-officio director.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Bfa 100) #5719, eff 10-13-93",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bfa100-500.html"
